[
    {
        "content": "<p>In <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/36478\">PR 36478</a>, I have added Schur's product. However, I doubt I have placed in the right file. The proof relies on CFC.sqrt, which needs <code>Matrix/Analysis/Matrix/Order</code>. The Kronecker product of two PSD matrices also requires that and is located in the file <code>Matrix/Analysis/Matrix/Order</code>. Hence, I placed Schur's product there too. Is this location okay, or is there a better one?</p>",
        "id": 578635549,
        "sender_full_name": "Tjeerd Jan Heeringa",
        "timestamp": 1773234797
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Nice! I don't know where it should go but you probably want to generalize it to allow for <code>n</code> infinite.</p>",
        "id": 578645330,
        "sender_full_name": "Hampus Nyberg",
        "timestamp": 1773237065
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The proof relies of <code>CFC.sqrt</code>. That doesn't work yet for <code>n</code> infinite, because <code>instNonnegSpectrumClass</code> for PSD matrices has <code>Fintype n</code>, which cannot be trivially removed. Changing that too feels like doing multiple things in one PR, which I was under the impression to not be a good thing. I would be happy to look into it in a separate PR though.</p>",
        "id": 578657403,
        "sender_full_name": "Tjeerd Jan Heeringa",
        "timestamp": 1773239694
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"983090\">@Tjeerd Jan Heeringa</span> that location is fine.</p>",
        "id": 578660023,
        "sender_full_name": "Jireh Loreaux",
        "timestamp": 1773240251
    },
    {
        "content": "<blockquote>\n<p>The proof relies of <code>CFC.sqrt</code>. That doesn't work yet for <code>n</code> infinite, because <code>instNonnegSpectrumClass</code> for PSD matrices has <code>Fintype n</code>, which cannot be trivially removed. Changing that too feels like doing multiple things in one PR, which I was under the impression to not be a good thing. I would be happy to look into it in a separate PR though.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>The finite case implies the infinite case by specializing to the support so you wouldn't need to redo the proof</p>",
        "id": 578664215,
        "sender_full_name": "Hampus Nyberg",
        "timestamp": 1773241154
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I got the infinite case by doing </p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Matrix</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">scoped</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MatrixOrder</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isDefEq</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">respectTransparency</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- The Hadamard product of two positive semidefinite matrices is positive semidefinite . -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PosSemidef</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">hadamard'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Matrix</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝕜</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hA</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PosSemidef</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hB</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PosSemidef</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊙</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PosSemidef</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">classical</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">IsHermitian</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">conjTranspose_hadamard'</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hA</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isHermitian</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hB</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isHermitian</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">support</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hAs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">submatrix</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Subtype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">val</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Subtype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">val</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PosSemidef</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hA</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">submatrix</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hBs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">submatrix</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Subtype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">val</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Subtype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">val</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PosSemidef</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hB</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">submatrix</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hHads</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hAs</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">hadamard</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hBs</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hsub</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊙</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">submatrix</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Subtype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">val</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Subtype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">val</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">submatrix</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Subtype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">val</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Subtype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">val</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊙</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">submatrix</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Subtype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">val</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Subtype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">val</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">ext</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">hadamard_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">submatrix_apply</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">subtypeDomain</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">support</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">subtype</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">univ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">ext</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"n\">hx</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"n\">hx</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">simp_all</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">univ_eq_attach</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">RCLike</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">star_def</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hadamard_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ge_iff_le</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">suffices</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xi</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">starRingEnd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝕜</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xi</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xj</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">             </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xi</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">starRingEnd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝕜</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xi</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↑</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↑</span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↑</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↑</span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xj</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hHads</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hsub</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Finsupp</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finsupp</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">support_subtypeDomain</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finsupp</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">subtypeDomain_apply</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">simp_rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">hs</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;-</span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum_attach</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">support</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>However, this feels way less slick than the other proof. So, I feel like this is not yet good enough. How would you go about making this better?</p>",
